dsh-agent-driver-writehere
==========================

This package ports the WriteHERE writing loop onto DeepSeek Harness as an
agent driver. It is not a file-for-file copy of the original Python runtime.

WriteHERE algorithm and type design
-----------------------------------

Xiong, Ruibin et al. (2025). Beyond Outlining: Heterogeneous Recursive
Planning for Adaptive Long-form Writing with Language Models.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.08275

Reference implementation:
https://github.com/principia-ai/WriteHERE

If you use this port in research, cite the paper above.

DeepSeek Harness
----------------

Plugin shape, Cordis composition, and the host Agent contract follow
DeepSeek Harness (MIT). See https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
